          "meeting_id": "05B3F0",
          "quote": "So, uh, officially this is the retro for the reliability sprint we kicked off after the March outage, and honestly I want to start by just saying — I think you both crushed it."
        },
        {
          "meeting_id": "433FFC",
          "quote": "So the incident started around 2:14 AM Pacific on March 10th. The event ingestion pipeline — this is the core processing layer that pulls in telemetry from customer environments — it had a cascading failure."
        },
