        {
          "meeting_id": "30237B",
          "quote": "The headline feature is on-demand compliance reporting, so you'll be able to generate SOC 2 reports, PCI DSS, HIPAA, ISO 27001 — all from within the platform, whenever you need them, without having to go through a manual evidence collection process."
