          "quote": "Perfect. So, Evelyn, today's really about finalizing the renewal for Bridgeport and making sure you're set up well going into the next contract year. But honestly, I also just wanted to take a step back and hear how things have been feeling from your side before we get into the paperwork side of things."
        },
        {
          "meeting_id": "4B7D41",
          "quote": "Look, I'll be honest with you — our renewal is coming up and I'm getting pressure from my CISO and from our compliance team and everyone is sort of, uh, looking at the platform and asking questions that I'm finding it hard to answer right now."
        },
        {
          "meeting_id": "DD7656",
          "quote": "Okay. So let's talk about the renewal because that's technically why we're here. Our contract comes up end of Q2 and, uh, I'll be transparent — the board is asking questions. They want to know if we have alternatives."
        }
      ]
